ex":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110530011:1":{"text":"ああ……もちろんだ。当日は、お前を担いででも試合に連れて行く。","source_cn":"呵……当然。初赛那天，我拎也要把你拎到赛场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD048E7960E259E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110530012:1":{"text":"ははっ、さすがはソーンだ。容赦ないなぁ。","source_cn":"啊——不要不要！索恩大人饶命啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x383988BC595B4C9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110530013:1":{"text":"あのぅ、マンカラはん。ワイが作ったあのドリンクの件についてやけど……","source_cn":"那个，曼卡拉大人，关于我之前那些个小饮料的小小问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x901D172ECA0053E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110530014:1":{"text":"二度としないって誓うなら、今回は見逃すわ。もしまたやったら、容赦しないわよ！","source_cn":"你保证不再犯，我这次就放过你。若敢再犯，数罪并罚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD538A963584C6286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110530015:1":{"text":"ほ、ほんまに見逃してくれるんか！？","source_cn":"真、真的？真的放过我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1F96F7A1732E1DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docume